#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * AURA — choose sound devices
 *
 *   Settings gets two tabs at the top: General (everything that was there) and Sound devices.
 *   Sound devices lists your speakers, headphones and mics: click one and Windows switches to it
 *   (calls too). Volume and mute for each. Star two favourites to flip between them with
 *   Ctrl + Alt + S or a new button on the AURA bar, each with its own mic. Optional: switch to your
 *   headset while a game runs. Windows only (the tab doesn't show elsewhere). Free, nothing to install.
 *
 * How to use:  node aura-sound-devices-setup.cjs      (in your AURA project folder)
 * To undo:     node aura-sound-devices-setup.cjs --undo
 */
